{
  "name": "黑马草上飞",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [134, 135, 136, 137, 138],
  "source": "黑马草上飞要求60日均线稳步上扬，股价沿60日均线斜率长期震荡上行，经过较长时间的‘草原式’推进后再向上突破原有上升通道，进入飞扬阶段。",
  "source_summary": "若60日均线长期上行、股价多数时间沿线运行，并最终突破近阶段通道高点，可视为黑马草上飞。",
  "comment": "当前主规则强调‘沿60日线上行一段时间后再突破’这一主干，不单独量化原文里的隐蔽建仓量区。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["close"],
  "warmup_bars": 200,
  "indicator_type": "breakout_rule",
  "params": {
    "ma_long_window": 60,
    "slope_lookback": 20,
    "channel_lookback": 120,
    "breakout_lookback": 40,
    "path_min_days": 60,
    "signal_keep_days": 5
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "ma_long",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_long_window",
      "description": "60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_long_ref",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "ma_long",
      "window": "$params.slope_lookback",
      "description": "向前平移后的60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "channel_high",
      "op": "highest",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.breakout_lookback",
      "description": "近阶段通道最高收盘价"
    },
    {
      "id": "channel_high_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "channel_high",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日通道最高收盘价"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "fly_breakout",
      "op": "breakout_up",
      "left": "close",
      "right": "channel_high_prev",
      "description": "突破原有震荡通道"
    }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {"op": "compare", "left": "ma_long", "operator": ">", "right": "ma_long_ref"},
          {
            "op": "before",
            "condition": {"op": "compare", "left": "close", "operator": ">=", "right": "ma_long"},
            "event": "fly_breakout",
            "window": "$params.channel_lookback",
            "min_count": "$params.path_min_days"
          },
          {"op": "condition", "event": "fly_breakout"}
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算60日均线，并与slope_lookback日前的60日均线比较，要求其保持上行。",
    "在channel_lookback日内统计股价沿60日线运行的天数，要求不少于path_min_days。",
    "以收盘价向上突破近阶段breakout_lookback日通道高点作为飞扬确认。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以沿60日均线推进后向上突破通道高点的当日作为黑马草上飞完成日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文中的‘大约半年’当前被收敛成 channel_lookback=120 与 path_min_days=60，需要后续回测确认。",
    "原文还提到飞扬前后未明显放量，当前未将量能约束写入主规则。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "warmup_bars >= ma_long_window + channel_lookback + 1。",
    "该规则更偏向中期趋势突破信号，而不是底部建仓识别。"
  ],
  "explain": "黑马草上飞被表达为长期沿60日均线上行后的中期通道突破。"
}
